  destinations:
  - destinationName: "Krak\xF3w Old Town"
    description: "Historic squares showcase centuries of heritage. Colorful buildings
      line lively cobblestone streets. Elegant architecture reflects a rich past.
      Caf\xE9s and markets create a welcoming atmosphere. History thrives in every
      corner. "
    background: {fileID: 4008016966793657660, guid: 9f10c262d16ec4d988f8af571e82a59d, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Wawel Castle Garden
    description: 'Royal gardens surround a historic castle complex. Flowerbeds brighten
      elegant walking paths. Ancient walls overlook scenic landscapes. Peaceful courtyards
      invite quiet exploration. A symbol of Polish heritage stands proudly. '
    background: {fileID: -2814264918725199439, guid: a9078439e258740f9833ab66e4877ff8, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Masurian Lakes
    description: Countless lakes connect through scenic waterways. Forests surround
      peaceful shorelines. Boats drift across calm blue waters. Nature flourishes
      throughout the region. A haven for outdoor exploration awaits.
    background: {fileID: -4149043097726553596, guid: dad4537f43ec34a889929527533644e6, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Zakopane Village
    description: Wooden chalets rest beneath mountain peaks. Traditional culture
      shapes the village atmosphere. Scenic trails lead into alpine landscapes. Fresh
      air fills the surrounding valleys. Mountain charm defines every view.
    background: {fileID: 7926524546434206154, guid: 3ff1ce90103bc47ca8662f666e1c4e6f, type: 3}
  - destinationName: "Gda\u0144sk Riverside"
    description: 'Historic waterfront buildings line scenic canals.  Ships and boats
      reflect the city''s maritime heritage. Colorful architecture brightens the
      riverside. Cobblestone streets invite exploration. History and culture meet
      beside the water. '
    background: {fileID: -3323321143110393830, guid: e2e2504100b9b45048065f236773813e, type: 3}
  - destinationName: "Royal \u0141azienki Park"
    description: Elegant gardens surround historic royal buildings. Tree-lined pathways
      create peaceful retreats. Lakes reflect beautiful architecture and greenery.Sculptures
      decorate scenic landscapes. A tranquil escape awaits visitors.
    background: {fileID: 1913466609366018840, guid: 34959b4cb49d44901b4286a90ef08055, type: 3}
